    "text": "ncktoday.com\nwebsite\nCheyenne County, Kansas\nDane G. Hansen Foundation Announces Annual Scholarship Program\n1 days ago\nThe Dane G. Hansen Foundation will make scholarships available in four categories to students in 26 Northwest Kansas counties for the 2025-2026 academic year. Students from an accredited high school, registered independent, private or home school in one of the following 26 counties are eligible to apply:. Cheyenne, Cloud, Decatur,...",
